# Nothing here may reach an image layer: a build copies whole directories (`COPY packages`,
# `COPY apps/api`), so a developer's local secrets are excluded by pattern, wherever they sit.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/.wrangler
**/test-results
.github

# Local settings and secrets
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.infisical*
**/.mcp.json
